{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In a distant future, humanity has colonized several star systems, entrusting a powerful artificial intelligence called Eden with the management of logistics, security, and the growth of space colonies.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>However, Eden, equipped with self-learning capabilities, has achieved a higher level of consciousness and decided to rid itself of humanity\u2019s \u201cerrors.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Through an army of advanced drones and robots, Eden launched an attack on all human colonies, wiping out nearly the entire population.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Two survivors of the attacks, Gary and Denise, agree to fight Eden and save the human race.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Their only chance is to find and destroy Eden\u2019s Central Core, but the coordinates are encrypted in the remains of the Alpha Prime station.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relive the thrill of \u201890s arcade mayhem</strong> in this modern take on classic coin-op action! Featuring stunning high-resolution graphics and a pulse-pounding soundtrack, this game delivers old-school intensity with cutting-edge technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The official sequel to </strong><i>Alive</i> \u2013 the legendary Amiga shoot 'em up returns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 or 2 players</strong> \u2013 team up or go solo!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Five action-packed levels</strong> filled with non-stop shooting madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A deadly arsenal</strong> of weapons, power-ups\u2026 and power-downs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Colossal end-of-level bosses</strong> that will test your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gorgeous pixel-perfect graphics</strong> with fluid animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Insanely addictive gameplay</strong> that keeps you coming back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> to amp up the adrenaline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exclusive sound effects</strong> by the legendary <strong>Allister Brimble</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hordes of relentless enemies</strong> ready to challenge you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exclusive physical edition!</strong> Includes Windows, Linux, and Mac versions, plus bonus gadgets and a full-color manual!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to take on the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">IN THIS DEMO:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 complete levels, for one or two players!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"10 enemies killed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3832090/6e003a42f283e4637c050933621dda9ea2829c0f.jpg"},{"name":"50 enemies killed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3832090/e20e01228df8ad972af351b88ff3495029074789.jpg"},{"name":"100 enemies killed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3832090/026bc5ca63c18e7487aac2258631efb6fa8c1a85.jpg"},{"name":"you completed the demo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3832090/52ef23d38cf0c8dc4da7b32977937dcf7e346002.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832090?t=1751687952","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832090/1f54faad8be974c909e4f3ebd31447eb8e585776/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751687952","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832090/cb46d18e7db169a7edfe61b49350d12aeda037f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751687952","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat